# coral-mobile · sandbox env
#
# The simplest path is `cd ../compass-live && pnpm onboard` — that script
# provisions both demos and auto-writes the MAYA_AGENT_ID + MAYA_AGENT_TOKEN
# values into this file. You still paste the three real secrets below.
#
# To point at production set SLY_API_URL=https://api.getsly.ai and use a
# pk_live_ tenant key. Demo is intended for sandbox/test only.

# ── Required (2 secrets) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# The only Sly secret. The demo lists agents on your tenant and auto-picks
# a T2 credit-class agent unless you pin one via MAYA_AGENT_ID below.
MAYA_TENANT_KEY=pk_test_REPLACE_ME

# Compass API key — read by the local `compass` binary.
COMPASS_API_KEY_AUTH=REPLACE_ME            # https://www.compasslabs.ai/dashboard

# Prerequisite (not an env var): the `compass` binary must be installed
# and on PATH. The canonical installer handles both:
#   curl -fsSL https://compasslabs.ai/install.sh | bash
# Set COMPASS_BIN below only if you installed it somewhere nonstandard.

# ── Optional ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pin a specific agent (otherwise the demo picks the first active T2
# "credit"-named agent on your tenant). Set via `pnpm onboard`.
# MAYA_AGENT_ID=

# Agent token. Needed only by the scope-request step (the agent asks Maya
# for permission); other Sly calls go through MAYA_TENANT_KEY with the
# agent_id in the body. If unset, the demo falls back to MAYA_TENANT_KEY
# for everything — fine for the demo flow.
# MAYA_AGENT_TOKEN=

# Pin the Compass Safe address (otherwise the demo reads it from
# /v1/agents/:id/wallet, which is populated automatically once you run
# the "Onboard agent" scenario in compass-live).
# MAYA_SAFE_ADDRESS=

# Override the path to `compass`. Only set if it's NOT on PATH.
# COMPASS_BIN=/usr/local/bin/compass

# Override the Base RPC. Defaults to https://mainnet.base.org.
# BASE_MAINNET_RPC_URL=

# Override the Sly API base URL. Defaults to sandbox.
# SLY_API_URL=https://sandbox.getsly.ai
